    "Leave as it is (until {date})" : "Los soos dit is (tot {date})",
    "Give the filter a name, so you know what it was for later." : "Gee die filter 'n naam, sodat jy later weet waarvoor dit was.",
    "One of the words is empty. Fill it in or take the row out — a filter with an empty word would match every post there is." : "Een van die woorde is leeg. Vul dit in of haal die ry uit - 'n filter met 'n leë woord sal pas by elke pos wat daar is.",
    "Tick at least one place for the filter to apply, or it does nothing anywhere." : "Merk ten minste een plek vir die filter om toe te pas, anders doen dit nêrens nie.",
    "New filter" : "Nuwe filter",
    "Editing “{title}”" : "Redigeer \"{title}\"",
    "This filter has expired and is not doing anything. Saving it starts it again for as long as the expiry below says." : "Hierdie filter het verval en doen niks. As u dit stoor, begin dit weer solank as wat die vervaldatum hieronder sê.",
    "Name of the filter" : "Naam van die filter",
    "What you are filtering, in your own words" : "Wat jy filter, in jou eie woorde",
    "Words to look for" : "Woorde om na te soek",
    "A post is filtered if any one of these appears in it: in the text, in the content warning, in the description of a picture or in the options of a poll. A boost is read as the post it boosts. Upper and lower case never matter." : "'n Pos word gefiltreer as enige een van hierdie daarin verskyn: in die teks, in die inhoudwaarskuwing, in die beskrywing van 'n prent of in die opsies van 'n meningspeiling. ’n Hupstoot word gelees as die pos wat dit ’n hupstoot gee. Hoofletters en kleinletters maak nooit saak nie.",
    "Word or phrase" : "Woord of frase",
    "Whole word only" : "Slegs die hele woord",
    "Remove this word" : "Verwyder hierdie woord",
    "“Whole word only” is the difference between filtering “cat” and also filtering every “catalogue”. It is decided for each word on its own." : "\"Slegs die hele woord\" is die verskil tussen die filter van \"kat\" en ook om elke \"katalogus\" te filter. Daar word vir elke woord op sy eie besluit.",
    "Add another word" : "Voeg nog 'n woord by",
    "Where it applies" : "Waar dit van toepassing is",
    "A filter only works in the places you tick. Somewhere you did not tick, a matching post arrives as usual." : "’n Filter werk net op die plekke wat jy afmerk. Iewers het jy nie gemerk nie, kom 'n bypassende pos soos gewoonlik aan.",
    "What happens to a post it matches" : "Wat met 'n plasing gebeur, pas by",
    "Fold it away, with a way to read it anyway" : "Vou dit weg, met 'n manier om dit in elk geval te lees",
    "The post keeps its place in the timeline, folded behind the name of this filter, and nothing of it is on the page until you press “Show anyway”. Nothing is kept from you — you are asked whether you want it." : "Die pos behou sy plek in die tydlyn, agter die naam van hierdie filter gevou, en niks daarvan is op die bladsy totdat jy \"Wys in elk geval\" druk nie. Niks word van jou weggehou nie - jy word gevra of jy dit wil hê.",
    "Take it out of the timeline" : "Haal dit uit die tydlyn",
    "The post is not sent to you at all, here or in any app, and a conversation containing one simply has a gap. Nothing is deleted and nobody is told: lift the filter and the post is back." : "Die plasing word glad nie aan jou gestuur nie, hier of in enige toepassing, en 'n gesprek wat een bevat het bloot 'n leemte. Niks word uitgevee nie en niemand word vertel nie: lig die filter op en die pos is terug.",
    "Stops applying after" : "Hou op om daarna aansoek te doen",
    "Create filter" : "Skep filter",
    "Cancel" : "Kanselleer",
    "{title} — in {places}" : "{title} — in {places}",
    "Posts carrying any of these are taken out of your timelines:" : "Plasings wat enige van hierdie bevat, word uit jou tydlyne geneem:",
    "Posts carrying any of these are folded away behind this filter’s name, and can still be opened:" : "Plasings wat enige hiervan dra, word agter hierdie filter se naam weggevou en kan steeds oopgemaak word:",
    "Nowhere — this filter names no timeline, so it does nothing" : "Nêrens nie - hierdie filter noem geen tydlyn nie, so dit doen niks",
    "In {places}" : "In {places}",
    "Could not load your filters" : "Kon nie jou filters laai nie",
    "The filter {title} is now applied" : "Die filter {title} is nou toegepas",
    "Could not create the filter" : "Kon nie die filter skep nie",
    "Could not save the filter" : "Kon nie die filter stoor nie",
    "The filter {title} is gone" : "Die filter {title} is weg",
    "Could not delete the filter" : "Kon nie die filter uitvee nie",
    "If a conversation seems to have a gap in it, this is why." : "As dit lyk of 'n gesprek 'n gaping in het, is dit hoekom.",
    "Loading your filters …" : "Laai tans jou filters …",
    "You have no filters. A filter is a word or a phrase you would rather not read: a post carrying it is folded away behind the filter’s name, or taken out of your timelines altogether." : "Jy het geen filters nie. 'n Filter is 'n woord of 'n frase wat jy liewer nie wil lees nie: 'n plasing wat dit dra, word agter die filter se naam weggevou, of heeltemal uit jou tydlyne geneem.",
