    "Follow" : "Volg",
    "Looking around …" : "Kyk rond …",
    "Nobody on this Nextcloud has said where they are on the fediverse yet. You are the first — your handle is now on your Nextcloud profile, so the next person will see you here." : "Niemand op hierdie Nextcloud het nog gesê waar hulle op die federasie is nie. Jy is die eerste – jou handvatsel is nou op jou Nextcloud-profiel, so die volgende persoon sal jou hier sien.",
    "Starter packs" : "Starter packs",
    "No starter packs on this server. Discover has suggestions and what is trending." : "Geen beginnerspakke op hierdie bediener nie. Ontdek het voorstelle en wat neiging is.",
    "Already somewhere else?" : "Reeds iewers anders?",
    "If you have an account on Mastodon or another server, bring the people you follow. Mastodon and servers like it export them as following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed as pixelfed-following.json — upload that file and each one is followed from here." : "As jy 'n rekening op Mastodon of 'n ander bediener het, bring die mense wat jy volg. Mastodon en bedieners soos dit voer hulle uit as following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed as pixelfed-following.json – laai daardie lêer op en elkeen word van hier af gevolg.",
    "Following …" : "Volg tans …",
    "Upload your follows" : "Laai jou volgelinge op",
    "On Mastodon: Preferences → Import and export → Data export → Follows (CSV). Moving your followers over as well is in Settings, under Migration — that one is a one-way move, so it is not a button here." : "Op Mastodon: Voorkeure → Invoer en uitvoer → Data-uitvoer → Volg (CSV). Om jou volgelinge ook oor te skuif, is in Instellings, onder Migrasie - daardie een is 'n eenrigtingskuif, so dit is nie 'n knoppie hier nie.",
    "That is all there is to it" : "Dit is al wat daar is",
    "Your feed fills up as the people you follow post. Meanwhile, say hello — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Jou stroom word vol soos die mense wat jy volg plaas. Sê intussen hallo - 'n eerste plasing is hoe die fediverse uitvind jy is hier.",
    "You have not followed anyone yet, and that is fine: Discover is always a click away in the sidebar. Say hello in the meantime — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Jy het nog niemand gevolg nie, en dit is goed: Ontdek is altyd 'n klik weg in die sybalk. Sê solank hallo - 'n eerste plasing is hoe die fediverse uitvind jy is hier.",
    "Back" : "Terug",
    "Next" : "Volgende",
    "Write your first post" : "Skryf jou eerste pos",
    "_Follow %n account_::_Follow all %n_" : ["Volg %n rekening", "Volg alle %n"],
    "Unfollow {account}" : "Ontvolg {account}",
    "Requested" : "Versoek",
    "Unfollow {account}?" : "Ontvolg {account}?",
    "Their posts stop appearing in your home timeline. If their account is locked you will have to ask again to follow them." : "Hul plasings hou op om in jou tuistydlyn te verskyn. As hul rekening gesluit is, sal jy weer moet vra om hulle te volg.",
    "{name}, followed. {reason}" : "{name}, gevolg. {reason}",
    "Follow {name}. {reason}" : "Volg {name}. {reason}",
    "People you might know, drawn around you" : "Mense wat jy dalk ken, rondom jou getrek",
    "_Followed by %n person you follow_::_Followed by %n people you follow_" : ["Gevolg deur %n persoon wat jy volg", "Gevolg deur %n mense wat jy volg"],
    "_Followed by {named} and %n other you follow_::_Followed by {named} and %n others you follow_" : ["Gevolg deur {named} en %n ander wat jy volg", "Gevolg deur {named} en %n ander wat jy volg"],
    "Look at who they follow" : "Kyk wie hulle volg",
    "Show as" : "Wys as",
    "List" : "Lys",
    "Constellation" : "Konstellasie",
    "Nobody new came out of it. Many servers do not publish who an account follows, so this works better the more people you follow." : "Niemand nuut het daaruit gekom nie. Baie bedieners publiseer nie wie 'n rekening volg nie, so dit werk beter hoe meer mense jy volg.",
    "_Follow one more account and this can look at who they follow._::_Follow {count} more accounts and this can look at who they follow._" : ["Volg nog een rekening en dit kan kyk wie hulle volg.", "Volg {count} meer rekeninge en dit kan kyk na wie hulle volg."],
    "Image gallery" : "Beeldgalery",
    "Previous image" : "Vorige prent",
    "Next image" : "Volgende prent",
    "Show image {number}" : "Wys prent {number}",
    "Followed hashtags" : "Het hashtags gevolg",
    "You are not following any hashtag yet." : "Jy volg nog geen hashtag nie.",
    "Take this post back" : "Neem hierdie pos terug",
    "Nothing of yours is waiting." : "Niks van jou wag nie.",
    "added by you" : "deur jou bygevoeg",
    "followed" : "gevolg",
    "learned" : "geleer",
    "Rank {rank} · {source} · score {score}" : "Rang {rank} · {source} · telling {score}",
    "#{tag}, priority {rank} of {total}, {source}, pinned" : "#{tag}, prioriteit {rank} van {total}, {source}, vasgespeld",
