    "Nothing is waiting to be posted. The clock in the composer schedules a post for later." : "Niks wag om geplaas te word nie. Die horlosie in die komponis skeduleer 'n plasing vir later.",
    "Search results for “{term}”" : "Soekresultate vir “{term}”",
